{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54764","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，斗大坠星来。\n或是作声长数丈，其间大战将星移（京本作「身摧」），急去免灾危。\n（京本注：「孔明、祖逖，皆有此兆。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}